OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill and McDonald attend police
OL,4,Ainterview over Garvaghy Road protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe First Minister Michelle O'Neill and
OL,7,FSinn Fein President Mary Lou McDonald
OL,8,Fhave attended police interviews over
OL,9,Ftheir involvement in protests on the
OL,10,FGarvaghy Road blocking an Orange Order
OL,11,Fparade last month.
OL,13,FUnionist parties have called for action
OL,14,Fagainst O'Neill and others over the
OL,15,Fprotests, accusing nationalist parties
OL,16,Fof acting unlawfully.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
