OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill and McDonald attend police
OL,4,Ainterview over Garvaghy Road protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on arrival at Musgrave Police
OL,7,FStation in Belfast on Wednesday,
OL,8,FMcDonald said they had stood on the
OL,9,Froad to "protect a vulnerable
OL,10,Fcommunity" and that it was "the right
OL,11,Fthing to do".
OL,13,F"We are here today to cooperate fully
OL,14,Fwith the PSNI," she added.
